reads unstated, which passes only when nothing could be added (lesson 27).", "LVN-to-RN pairs ANAT 10A or ANAT 35 and ANAT 10B or ANAT 36: two whole sequences, ANAT 10A+10B or ANAT 35+36.", "Fire Technology's elective block offers two paths: any two FIRE courses, or FIRE 86 and KINF 53 plus one more FIRE course; it prints no units beside the electives.", "Early Childhood Education's trailing 1 and 2 after titles are footnote markers, not units."], "requests": [], "workarounds": [{"for": "Outcomes behind a tab", "tried": "The capture appends any panel an Outcomes, SLO or PLO tab opens (#1871)", "result": "worked (4 of 4)"}], "request_ready": false}$proc$::jsonb, 'S344 SkyWaypoint, 2026-10-08 (scheduled run; handoff 344 priority 1)', 'none') as result;
