select public.program_source_procedure_set('West Los Angeles College', $proc${"v": 1, "college": "West Los Angeles College", "reader": "kb/_program_requirements_pilot.py (robots.txt first, the census's delay and user agent); a capture follows links on the catalog's host only (lesson 24)", "hosts": [{"host": "www.wlac.edu", "access": "open", "platform": "pdf", "note": "The 2026-27 catalog as one PDF (/sites/wlac.edu/files/2026-08/2026_2027%20catalog.pdf, 358 pages), read with pypdf. The capture finds a program's pages by its listed codes (Computer Network & Security Management 88-91, Kinesiology A.A.-T 123-124, Real Estate Salesperson 151-152, Real Estate Appraiser 246). The page about the program mapper (/academics/pathways/program-mapper) answered on 2026-10-04."}, {"host": "programmap.wlac.edu", "access": "unreached", "platform": "outside", "note": "The college's program mapper, linked from its mapper page; not yet read. Every mapper host probed on 2026-10-04 refused the reader (run 37198225537)."}], "steps": [{"run": "37166814546", "date": "2026-10-04", "plan": "capture, the pilot sample (capture run 4)", "found": "4 of 4 programs from the catalog PDF (17111, 37050, 37839, 39618), with outcomes."}, {"run": "37198225537", "date": "2026-10-04", "plan": "the sequence probe", "found": "The mapper page answers and links programmap.wlac.edu, which was not loaded."}], "answers": [{"question": "Where the catalog prints each program's requirements", "status": "answered", "answer": "The single catalog PDF, found by the listed codes. All four records pass the four checks (Sam, 2026-10-04)."}], "open": [{"question": "Whether programmap.wlac.edu opens to the reader", "next": "One load from a runner; a refusal is the mapper service's and is not retried another way."}], "nuances": ["A section can begin on the page before its first listed code: Kinesiology A.A.-T's heading and description sit on page 122, outside the excerpt.", "A section can run across a page break (Real Estate